{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ninja Arena</strong> is an online FPS focused on speed, mobility, and mastery of ninjutsu techniques. Players face off in dynamic arenas where movement precision and quick reflexes determine the outcome of every duel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>mudra system</strong> allows players to combine hand signs to activate various ninja techniques: three signs for standard attacks, and five for powerful ultimate abilities. This mechanic introduces a strategic and rhythmic layer to combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-paced online multiplayer combat.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mudra system</strong> allowing players to combine offensive and defensive ninja techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fluid, vertical gameplay</strong> with agile movement such as wall runs, air dashes, and slides.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized and varied arenas</strong> including floating villages, sky platforms, water arenas, and airborne trains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible and dynamic experience</strong>, designed for short, intense play sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ninja Arena</strong> offers a modern combat experience blending agility, strategy, and precision, set in an abstract world inspired by ninjutsu.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3944890?t=1762358644","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944890/a957ff91849093f079c756e979c62487e0aa164e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762358644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944890/4f9ad3a85fd38f45537d0c988965a19f20ead5af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762358644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as